# Never bake secrets into an image layer. AGENT_KEY_ENCRYPTION_SECRET decrypts
# every stored per-user Aster agent key; it is supplied at run time via
# env_file. .env.example is a placeholder-only file and harmless, but there is
# no reason for it in the image either.
.env
.env.*

